{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["Like rivers they stretch out — ננטיו. Straight." "Like tents — like: מור ואהלות. כַּאֲהָלִים כַּאֲרָזִים עלי מים — pathach, because it is in the place of a hatef. כארזים על יבלי מים. But in חור כארזים — qamets, because it is determinate, as in כְּהָאֲרָזִים."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:50:53.878596750Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}